{"feeds": {"type": "feed", "id": "187347118949140480", "url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "title": "字节跳动技术团队", "description": "字节跳动的技术实践分享\n(wechat feed made by @ttttmr https://wechat2rss.xlab.app)", "siteUrl": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/feed/d3a9e4d6f125cc98d1691dbc30cd97fec7ae2d03.xml", "image": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Q3auHgzwzM4Mz0zV5VtfHx3vA6LLNw3npTWibbGbYhtsc131DoN6m0A/0", "errorMessage": null, "errorAt": null, "ownerUserId": null}, "entries": {"feedId": "187347118949140480", "id": "249808132357788672", "title": "Seedance 2.0 登上春晚大屏：8K/50FPS背后的最佳拍档", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247518556&idx=1&sn=be0391ea10160062902fb9a5f2e5b540", "content": "<p>原创 <span>视频与边缘</span> <span>2026-02-26 17:05</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">北京</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=975c561a&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FeeBXXc7eQWUpWxxnGkUvqdgmzvKTCayvy6WCibMorpe09nNPgwwuadicBKBVjcZQxUicuwTPze9aI3icUiaCjYaK0BE490zG0KzW8X4%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\"></p>\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>《驭风歌》</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>让水墨国宝“活”起来</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=15a84f8d&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_gif%2FFGB4hYw9Fef6ETNMzoOrVF8UxiaKiaQic9DwD9PibXf6pFqiaDOtWu6SG8nWVXQs3DwybNEN7SzTIJibvMjQ6y6wbWny4KyicGYtwtzEw0nggFICWQ%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>《贺花神》</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>让极致细节被精准控制</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=41e600f7&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FFGB4hYw9FecpedZRgFxRd19sRBD3f5NsBWTIkzFjPcIY4AJSB5eodfWPaCXCUzWMricKTxaUjDqPk3bPnENxV5iapyazSRzZALmBibGxEmL4EM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>2026年总台马年春晚，以“骐骥驰骋 势不可挡”为主题，坚持“思想+艺术+技术”融合传播，不断拓宽表达边界。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>由大模型驱动的AIGC视频内容正加速进入主流，但要登上央视春晚这样的国家级视听盛宴舞台，仍面临严苛的技术壁垒。2026年春晚首次引入由 Seedance 2.0 生成的创意视频内容，其落地的关键之一，在于攻克了8K分辨率 + 50FPS高帧率这一行业级播出标准的技术瓶颈。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>目前，包括 Seedance 在内的全球主流视频生成模型，普遍仅能直接输出 720P或1080P / 24FPS 的视频。这与春晚要求的 8K分辨率和 50帧每秒（FPS） 的播出规格存在极大差距。为解决这一技术难题，火山引擎视频与边缘团队深度介入，依托火山引擎智能媒体处理平台的多维度智能画质增强框架，对AIGC内容实施了一场全流程、AI驱动的“智能精修”。</span></p></div><div style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>智能精修：从“一刀切”到“一镜一策”</span></strong></p></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>传统视频增强依赖人工预设规则，适应性差、效果有限。而火山引擎推出的视频点播画质增强服务，构建了一套全新的智能精修范式——以深度视频理解为基础、精准画质指标决策为核心，实现自适应、高保真、全场景适配的增强能力。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>该系统的核心理念是“一镜一策”：通过镜头级粒度的AI分析，自动识别每一镜头的内容特征与失真类型，并智能预测最优修复路径，动态组合专属增强工具链，全程无需人工调参或反复试错。</span></p></div><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>技术双引擎：超分 + 抽帧，打通AIGC上屏最后一公里</span></strong></p></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>为满足春晚播出标准，火山引擎重点突破两大关键技术：</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>超分辨率重建（Super-Resolution）</span></strong></span><span><br></span><span>在不改变原始画面语义的前提下，将720P输入智能升频至8K级别。算法不仅放大尺寸，更重建高频细节，使画面在巨幕上依然清晰锐利。</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>智能帧率提升（Frame Interpolation）</span></strong></span><span><br></span><span>针对AIGC原生24FPS的局限，通过先进的时序插帧技术，将帧率平滑提升至50FPS。生成的中间帧自然连贯，显著提升动态流畅度，实现“肉眼可见”的观感升级。</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>这两项技术共同构成了AIGC内容登上春晚大屏的关键桥梁。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: middle;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;align-self: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>三位一体画质增强体系：理解—决策—执行</span></strong></p></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>除了规格提升，画质保真同样至关重要。火山引擎的画质增强方案由三大技术模块协同支撑：</span></p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>深度视频理解</span></strong></span><span><br></span><span>超越像素级分析，实现语义级认知：精准定位主体区域、关键动作与复合失真（如压缩模糊、色彩偏移、多场景混合伪影），为后续增强提供上下文感知基础。</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>多维画质指标决策</span></strong></span><span><br></span><span>融合无参考指标（如VQScore、SRQA）与全参考评估（异常检测、纹理保真度等），结合动态权重分配与子项协同约束机制，科学量化不同失真对观感的影响，避免传统“一刀切”策略，真正做到“因片施策”。</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>可组合增强原子能力库</span></strong></span><span><br></span><span>内置去噪、锐化、去压缩失真、色彩增强、超分、以及基于Diffusion的生成式增强（如GenDR/DenVR）等高质量原子算法。这些模块可灵活组合、精准调用，持续抬升智能精修的效果上限。</span></p></li></ol><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>最终输出的视频不仅满足8K/50FPS的硬性播出标准，更有效抑制了AIGC常见的微小瑕疵，同时完整保留了Seedance 2.0独特的艺术风格与创意表达——既高清，又自然；既流畅，又有灵魂。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>此次合作标志着AIGC内容正式迈入高规格专业视听领域，也为未来影视、直播、XR等场景的大规模应用铺平了技术道路。</span></p></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></div><p style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.volcengine.com/contact/product?t=%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E7%82%B9%E6%92%AD%5cx26amp;source=%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E5%92%A8%E8%AF%A2\" target=\"_blank\">阅读原文</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/link-proxy/?k=e742876e&#x26;r=1&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%3F__biz%3DMzI1MzYzMjE0MQ%3D%3D%26mid%3D2247518556%26idx%3D1%26sn%3Dbe0391ea10160062902fb9a5f2e5b540\" target=\"_blank\">跳转微信打开</a></p>", "description": "原创 视频与边缘 2026-02-26 17:05 北京 《驭风歌》\n\n让水墨国宝“活”起来\n\n《贺花神》\n\n让极致细节被精准控制\n\n2026年总台马年春晚，以“骐骥驰骋 势不可挡”为主题，坚持“思想+艺术+技术”融合传播，不断拓宽表达边界。\n\n由大模型驱动的AIGC视频内容正加速进入主流，但要登上央视春晚这样的国家级视听盛宴舞台，仍面临严苛的技术壁垒。2026年春晚首次引入由 Seedance 2.0 生成的创意视频内容，其落地的关键之一，在于攻克了8K分辨率 + 50FPS高帧率这一行业级播出标准的技术瓶颈。\n\n目前，包括 Seedance…", "guid": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247518556&idx=1&sn=be0391ea10160062902fb9a5f2e5b540", "author": null, "authorUrl": null, "authorAvatar": null, "insertedAt": "2026-02-26T11:31:54.067Z", "publishedAt": "2026-02-26T09:05:00.324Z", "media": [{"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=975c561a&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FFGB4hYw9FeeBXXc7eQWUpWxxnGkUvqdgmzvKTCayvy6WCibMorpe09nNPgwwuadicBKBVjcZQxUicuwTPze9aI3icUiaCjYaK0BE490zG0KzW8X4%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg", "type": "photo", "width": 1280, "height": 544}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=15a84f8d&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_gif%2FFGB4hYw9Fef6ETNMzoOrVF8UxiaKiaQic9DwD9PibXf6pFqiaDOtWu6SG8nWVXQs3DwybNEN7SzTIJibvMjQ6y6wbWny4KyicGYtwtzEw0nggFICWQ%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}, {"url": "https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=41e600f7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FFGB4hYw9FecpedZRgFxRd19sRBD3f5NsBWTIkzFjPcIY4AJSB5eodfWPaCXCUzWMricKTxaUjDqPk3bPnENxV5iapyazSRzZALmBibGxEmL4EM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dgif%26from%3Dappmsg", "type": "photo"}], "categories": null, "attachments": null, "extra": {}, "language": null, "summary": "Seedance 2.0’s AI‑generated videos were showcased at the 2026 Spring Festival Gala, meeting the show’s 8K/50 FPS broadcast requirement. To bridge the gap between typical 720‑/1080‑P/24 FPS output and the gala’s standards, Volcano Engine’s video team applied an end‑to‑end “intelligent refinement” workflow. This combined super‑resolution Upscaling, frame interpolation, deep content understanding, and a modular enhancement library to deliver high‑fidelity, frame‑smooth 8K content while preserving artistic detail."}, "settings": {}}